# 统一行尾：所有文本文件在仓库与检出时均为 LF，
# 避免 Windows core.autocrlf 造成 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 反复转换警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary
*.engine binary
*.plan binary
*.npz binary
*.csv binary
